{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-106635","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-171829","text":"RuneFort"}]},{"id":"blk-106636","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-171830","text":"A layout protocol for tiled, file-backed UIs. Four primitives — room, claim, neighbor, binding — declared as JSON that lives in a repository."}]},{"id":"blk-106637","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-171831","text":"The landing page is GENERATED. Do not hand-edit "},{"id":"spn-171832","marks":["code"],"text":"index.html"},{"id":"spn-171833","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-106638","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-171834","marks":["code"],"text":"/index.html"},{"id":"spn-171835","text":" and "},{"id":"spn-171836","marks":["code"],"text":"/tiles.js"},{"id":"spn-171837","text":" are emitted by "},{"id":"spn-171838","marks":["code"],"text":"build-site.mjs"},{"id":"spn-171839","text":" from "},{"id":"spn-171840","marks":["code"],"text":"records/surface.json"},{"id":"spn-171841","text":", "},{"id":"spn-171842","marks":["code"],"text":"records/weights.json"},{"id":"spn-171843","text":", "},{"id":"spn-171844","marks":["code"],"text":"src/landing.html"},{"id":"spn-171845","text":", "},{"id":"spn-171846","marks":["code"],"text":"src/shell.css"},{"id":"spn-171847","text":" and "},{"id":"spn-171848","marks":["code"],"text":"src/tiles.js"},{"id":"spn-171849","text":". "},{"id":"spn-171850","marks":["bold"],"text":"An edit to the served HTML is silently reverted by the next build."},{"id":"spn-171851","text":" Change the record or the template."}]},{"id":"blk-106639","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"npm run test:launch    # emit the site, then run the publication gate"},{"id":"blk-106640","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-171852","marks":["code"],"text":"build-site.mjs"},{"id":"spn-171853","text":" walks the ES module import graph from each entry point and gzips what it reaches, so "},{"id":"spn-171854","marks":["bold"],"text":"every byte figure on the page is measured, never typed"},{"id":"spn-171855","text":", and the build refuses when a figure moves without its record. "},{"id":"spn-171856","marks":["code"],"text":"launch-gate.mjs"},{"id":"spn-171857","text":" reads the emitted artifact and refuses on the other ways a page lies — a retracted claim reinstated, a rung invented, a CTA the rung has not earned, a "},{"id":"spn-171858","marks":["code"],"text":"mailto:"},{"id":"spn-171859","text":", a text token below 4.5:1, a documented path that resolves to nothing, an artifact that is not what its source compiles to, an identifying-animation constant leaking into the copy. "},{"id":"spn-171860","marks":["bold"],"text":"129 checks."},{"id":"spn-171861","text":" The shell is documented in "},{"id":"spn-171862","marks":["code"],"text":"ProjectAmp2/agents/SHELL.md"},{"id":"spn-171863","text":"; this surface is built against revision "},{"id":"spn-171864","marks":["bold"],"text":"`shell-r9`"},{"id":"spn-171865","text":", recorded as "},{"id":"spn-171866","marks":["code"],"text":"shell_revision"},{"id":"spn-171867","text":" in "},{"id":"spn-171868","marks":["code"],"text":"records/surface.json"},{"id":"spn-171869","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-106641","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-171870","marks":["bold"],"text":"Do not hand-type a check count anywhere."},{"id":"spn-171871","text":" The gate prints its own total; the number above is what it printed on 2026-08-17, and it went 93 → 129 in a single session."}]},{"id":"blk-106642","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-171872","text":"Two checks are newer than the rest and are the ones to understand first:"}]},{"id":"blk-106643","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-106645","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-171873","marks":["bold"],"text":"The computed-colour resolver."},{"id":"spn-171874","text":" Travis reported the header CTA unreadable and he was"}]}],"id":"blk-106644","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-106646","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-171875","text":"right: "},{"id":"spn-171876","marks":["code"],"text":".top nav a"},{"id":"spn-171877","text":" is specificity 0,2,1 and "},{"id":"spn-171878","marks":["code"],"text":".btn"},{"id":"spn-171879","text":" is 0,1,0, so the nav rule won and \"Walk a fort\" painted "},{"id":"spn-171880","marks":["code"],"text":"rgba(233,234,228,.66)"},{"id":"spn-171881","text":" on "},{"id":"spn-171882","marks":["code"],"text":"#9ee04f"},{"id":"spn-171883","text":" — "},{"id":"spn-171884","marks":["bold"],"text":"1.19:1"},{"id":"spn-171885","text":" — while the identical button in the hero painted "},{"id":"spn-171886","marks":["code"],"text":"#0b1403"},{"id":"spn-171887","text":" correctly. "},{"id":"spn-171888","marks":["bold"],"text":"Every contrast check here passed the whole time"},{"id":"spn-171889","text":", because they read "},{"id":"spn-171890","marks":["italic"],"text":"declared tokens"},{"id":"spn-171891","text":" and never the colour the cascade gives a real element. The gate now resolves the cascade over the emitted artifact (specificity, source order, "},{"id":"spn-171892","marks":["code"],"text":"!important"},{"id":"spn-171893","text":", "},{"id":"spn-171894","marks":["code"],"text":"@media"},{"id":"spn-171895","text":" at 1600/1280/800/390, "},{"id":"spn-171896","marks":["code"],"text":"var()"},{"id":"spn-171897","text":", inheritance) against each "},{"id":"spn-171898","marks":["code"],"text":".btn"},{"id":"spn-171899","text":"'s real ancestor chain. Verdicts were cross-checked against the browser's computed styles and agreed on all four buttons. A selector it cannot parse is a REFUSAL, not a skip; finding zero buttons is a REFUSAL."}]},{"id":"blk-106647","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-106649","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-171900","marks":["bold"],"text":"The correction form's shape"},{"id":"spn-171901","text":" (SHELL.md r9): the "},{"id":"spn-171902","marks":["code"],"text":"action"},{"id":"spn-171903","text":" must equal the endpoint the"}]}],"id":"blk-106648","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-106650","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-171904","text":"record declares, and "},{"id":"spn-171905","marks":["code"],"text":"_gotcha"},{"id":"spn-171906","text":" must be present — a honeypot dropped in a refactor fails silently."}]},{"id":"blk-106651","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-171907","marks":["code"],"text":"/app/"},{"id":"spn-171908","text":" (the editor) is hand-authored, predates this shell, and is NOT generated. It is the surface's "},{"id":"spn-171909","marks":["code"],"text":"live_deployed"},{"id":"spn-171910","text":" artifact."}]},{"id":"blk-106652","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-171911","marks":["bold"],"text":"The band says \"a specification in the ComputeDriven world\", not \"the interface layer of ComputeDriven\", and that is deliberate."},{"id":"spn-171912","text":" "},{"id":"spn-171913","marks":["code"],"text":"ampersand-nav"},{"id":"spn-171914","text":" records runefort as "},{"id":"spn-171915","marks":["code"],"text":"place: 3"},{"id":"spn-171916","text":", and its own "},{"id":"spn-171917","marks":["code"],"text":"renderPlacement()"},{"id":"spn-171918","text":" gives the layer sentence to "},{"id":"spn-171919","marks":["code"],"text":"place: 2"},{"id":"spn-171920","text":" only."}]},{"id":"blk-106653","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-171921","text":"Spec — there is NO "},{"id":"spn-171922","marks":["code"],"text":"docs/spec/README.md"},{"id":"spn-171923","text":" here"}]},{"id":"blk-106654","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-171924","text":"RuneFort is the one Tier-3 domain in the portfolio without one, and the root "},{"id":"spn-171925","marks":["code"],"text":"CLAUDE.md"},{"id":"spn-171926","text":" pointed at that filename until 2026-08-15. The real files:"}]},{"id":"blk-106655","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-106657","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-171927","marks":["code"],"text":"docs/spec/runefort.protocol.md"},{"id":"spn-171928","text":" — the protocol (start here)"}]}],"id":"blk-106656","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-106659","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-171929","marks":["code"],"text":"docs/spec/runefort.core.md"},{"id":"spn-171930","text":" — the Web Component API"}]}],"id":"blk-106658","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-106661","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-171931","marks":["code"],"text":"docs/spec/runefort.dsl.md"},{"id":"spn-171932","text":" — the "},{"id":"spn-171933","marks":["code"],"text":".rune"},{"id":"spn-171934","text":" syntax. "},{"id":"spn-171935","marks":["bold"],"text":"No parser exists for it."}]}],"id":"blk-106660","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-106662","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-171936","text":"What is built, and what only reads as built"}]},{"id":"blk-106663","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-106665","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-171937","marks":["bold"],"text":"Built and measured on the deployed domain:"},{"id":"spn-171938","text":" "},{"id":"spn-171939","marks":["code"],"text":"<rune-floor>"},{"id":"spn-171940","text":", "},{"id":"spn-171941","marks":["code"],"text":"<rune-room>"},{"id":"spn-171942","text":","}]}],"id":"blk-106664","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-106666","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-171943","marks":["code"],"text":"<rune-claim>"},{"id":"spn-171944","text":", "},{"id":"spn-171945","marks":["code"],"text":"<rune-link>"},{"id":"spn-171946","text":" — a declaration compiles to real CSS grid tracks."}]},{"id":"blk-106667","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-106669","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-171947","marks":["bold"],"text":"Built, unmeasured:"},{"id":"spn-171948","text":" the other ten custom elements, the templates, the generation"}]}],"id":"blk-106668","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-106670","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-171949","text":"runtime."}]},{"id":"blk-106671","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-106673","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-171950","marks":["bold"],"text":"Not built:"},{"id":"spn-171951","text":" the "},{"id":"spn-171952","marks":["code"],"text":".rune"},{"id":"spn-171953","text":" parser, any conformance suite, any second renderer."}]}],"id":"blk-106672","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-106675","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-171954","marks":["bold"],"text":"Built with no backend:"},{"id":"spn-171955","text":" "},{"id":"spn-171956","marks":["code"],"text":"packages/core/src/supabase.js"},{"id":"spn-171957","text":". This portfolio ruled the"}]}],"id":"blk-106674","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-106676","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-171958","text":"shared-Supabase route abandoned on 2026-07-30; the adapter is still inside the documented entry point and still costs its bytes."}]},{"id":"blk-106677","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-171959","text":"Weight — do not quote a number from memory"}]},{"id":"blk-106678","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-171960","marks":["code"],"text":"records/weights.json"},{"id":"spn-171961","text":" is regenerated on every build. As of 2026-08-16: the four layout primitives with their dependencies are "},{"id":"spn-171962","marks":["bold"],"text":"24,443 bytes raw / 6,794 gzipped"},{"id":"spn-171963","text":"; the documented entry point "},{"id":"spn-171964","marks":["code"],"text":"src/index.js"},{"id":"spn-171965","text":" reaches 19 modules at "},{"id":"spn-171966","marks":["bold"],"text":"163,749 / 42,065"},{"id":"spn-171967","text":". The old "},{"id":"spn-171968","marks":["code"],"text":"~5KB"},{"id":"spn-171969","text":" figure is retracted on the landing page and is in the gate's blocklist."}]}],"edges":[],"id":"bagaaieraje7f62momlopvga4nlqxgxoqjdmycuidjfcrajkohe6d32hl6lvq","vocabulary":"ampersand.docs.fs.v1"}